{
  "layer": "requirements",
  "type": "requirement",
  "name": "project-templates",
  "body": "Project templates: every kalide project defines its own templates and assets (slide/section templates, themes, fonts, logos and any other media such as video) as a template library. By default the library is a `templates/` directory at the project root, alongside `slides/`, `assets/` and `kalide.yaml`; a deck may instead point at an external library directory via `kalide.yaml` (see external-template-library). Exactly one library per deck. The binary ships none (no fallback). Parent of the project-templates feature.",
